## 📊 Dataset Information

The project uses historical datasets related to:

- Lake Biwa Water Quality
- Lake Biwa Water Level
- Earthquake Records around Lake Biwa

The water-quality dataset contains annual observations from 1979 to 2018. The water-level dataset currently covers January 1993.

